<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-12T20:59:02.015Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities detained 14 suspected Sinaloa cartel members in Chiapas, including two regional leaders, while a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7‑year-old American girl. In the United States, an ICE officer in Maine who expressed anti-immigrant views was involved in the fatal shooting of an immigrant, and investigations revealed a troubling history for that officer. A Los Angeles gang member and a cartel boss were indicted for helping fugitive Ryan Wedding evade capture after the boss provided fake police identification. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/b4bb6e99-97c8-4392-a227-b7b74853ba26?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPSDJMU3FZUEdVZEgyazB0MU9pbndQZDVHS0RBUG5sUE5lRk53SVVhM3lzREFodG9KS2oyZVcxWHZFdHU0UmVHWGxFM0tOS3pIUEU3S2laXzdRMjhPLWJKYzZLUjZCUDVQNG5YRHl1YUVMWkJjOUY2OGhuVlFrbk55UER6RGxjcjFSRGpN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQOHg4SG1YVGVmd216dVkydUxNRERxZjZTOHdORS16MldQUzBrXzl0Z3RmZ0VJeVplWFBZdlZUbExVSHBlSGt3VUtmUll4TzZoaGhRY3p6RzJocXVZVU1iSzk2R2VaY3NoUzBPQTVsTGtjemRLUFcwbmQ1S1hlRWlVMHNhQmtSaDAwQXlETjZrNmFLWVJjUHJXN202cDU3ZE5ZS0ww?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQdS1GbzltMHFZb0VRZ3dOSVdsWS1IY3cwVkJOd0lrTUVSOTZxRy16bHFqSFFQa1IxUlU0RjhtZlk3RlJqU2JSVVpxZHh1NGVXS2FVbDNCTEFDWnp1VGxFUlJLNGJyVlpmU3VnRDF5TXZBYlkyWDdIV0pjSjNZMktlLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3374243/trump-threatens-double-tariffs-mexico-if-it-does-not-halt-migrants&quot;&